sks... and then, uh, tick off the first one and delete the second one\", \"ok so, different thing, where do I stand with Libor in, um, harpoon share?\", \"uh, and Tonu?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0043\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to square away the holiday costs, so how much does Panagiota Figueroa owe me in Madeira house share?\", \"Oh, on another note, I keep forgetting to plan catch-ups — when am I next seeing Cosima?\", \"Right, things have shifted around a bit, so could you move the first one to thursday and just cancel the second one altogether?\"], [\"Could you tell me how much Panagiota Figueroa owes me in Madeira house share, please?\", \"Also, would you mind checking when I'm next seeing Cosima?\", \"Thank you. Could you please move the first one to thursday and cancel the second one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0044\", \"v\": [[\"can u pull up the Haivex council entry in my locker, just the entry not the pw\", \"oh and save the gate code 84383 in the locker pls\", \"also wanna settle up w everyone in the Akureyri trip group\"], [\"umm can you find the Haivex council thing in my locker? just the entry, I don't need the password\", \"oh and, uh, can you save the gate code, it's 84383, in the locker\", \"ok different thing, um, I wanna square up with the whole Akureyri trip group\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0045\", \"v\": [[\"uh what's the... what's the actual Haivex council password?\"], [\"I'm sitting on the council website and I've completely blanked on how to get in, so what's my actual Haivex council password again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0047\", \"v\": [[\"delete every Thagewen event\"], [\"umm can you clear out, like, every Thagewen event on my calendar?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0048\", \"v\": [[\"I know I've got something coming up with Lars but I can't for the life of me remember when, so when is my Lars thing?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my Lars thing is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0049\", \"v\": [[\"um what've I got that's, like, Lars related?\", \"oh hang on, quick one, which chalk tasks haven't I done yet?\", \"ok going back to what we were doing... can you just show me the third one?\"], [\"Lars stuff?\", \"wait — unfinished chalk tasks?\", \"back to before — just the third\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0050\", \"v\": [[\"Somebody mentioned the gargoyle thing earlier and I totally blanked on it, so when is my gargoyle thing again?\", \"Separate thing — I'm thinking of starting completely fresh, so could you wipe everything in my vault?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my gargoyle thing is, please?\", \"On a different matter, would you please delete everything in my vault?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0051\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me what I've written recently in my journal, please?\", \"How many are there in total, please?\"], [\"show me what i wrote recently in my journal\", \"how many r there total\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0052\", \"v\": [[\"delete the ferry task\", \"Vrilie owes me how much?\", \"called them today, log it\", \"sorry, Flendie, not them\"], [\"Could you please delete the ferry task?\", \"Also, could you tell me how much Vrilie owes me?\", \"I called them today — would you mind logging that?\", \"Sorry, my mistake — it was Flendie I called, not them. Could you correct that, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0053\", \"v\": [[\"delete damson task\", \"look up Shora\", \"settle up with Vrovsais, Akureyri trip\"], [\"can u delete the damson task\", \"also look up Shora for me\", \"ok wanna settle up w Vrovsais in Akureyri trip\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0054\", \"v\": [[\"when's Bastien's birthday\", \"how many tasks r due next week\", \"what've i got filed under Energy\"], [\"I want to get a card sorted in good time for once, so when is Bastien's birthday?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to gauge how busy things are going to get, so how many tasks are due next week?\", \"And one more, since I'm sorting through my paperwork anyway — what have I got filed under Energy?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0055\", \"v\": [[\"Bastien dinner when?\", \"hang on — coral thing when?\", \"nah, leave it\", \"who's coming to it?\", \"Panagiota — phoned her, log it\"], [\"Could you tell me when my Bastien dinner is, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on — could you tell me when the coral business is?\", \"Actually, no, please just leave it.\", \"Could you tell me who's coming to it?\", \"About Panagiota — I phoned her. Could you log that, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0056\", \"v\": [[\"My list is getting really cluttered and I've already sorted that one out, so could you delete the ask flendie task?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to plan my week — what's my first appointment tuesday?\", \"Oh, that reminds me, I've been meaning to double-check things — can you add a task to check the Kanya booking?\"], [\"Could you please delete the ask flendie task?\", \"What is my first appointment on tuesday, please?\", \"Could you add a task to check the Kanya booking, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0057\", \"v\": [[\"Would you please delete the damson task?\", \"I met up with Lars for coffee; could you log that, please?\"], [\"I've already dealt with all that so it's just clutter now — can you get rid of the damson task?\", \"Oh, I finally caught up with Lars over coffee, it was lovely actually — could you log that for me?\"]]}","ttft_ms":33244,"type":"result","duration_ms":46923,"uuid":"7829552f-8fdf-43a7-8d82-eeca46efd563","ttft_stream_ms":1406,"time_to_request_ms":191,"first_content_frame_ms":1407,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22498222,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279048820.7534,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
